@title Dragon Ball Z - The Legacy of Goku II (USA)
@file Dragon Ball Z - The Legacy of Goku II (U) [!].gba
@game ALFE
@chip EEPROM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: nothing is written to EEPROM through the Trunks prologue; the pause menu has no Save, the game saves only at Save Points and none is in the prologue area. After Gohan's training, "Stay here", the climb up the cleft in the north cliff to Gohan (talk to him from the side) and the rain scene at his body, Trunks is back in control on the same small plateau and no way out of it was found (the boulder on the west ledge does not break; the ledge and the north notch dead-end)

# New Game > the story > Gohan's training (melee boulder, energy-blast
# boulder, the Super Saiyan cutscene) > "Stay here, I'll take care of them" >
# walk up-right, up-left, up to the notch in the north cliff face; UP+LEFT
# inside it climbs to the upper plateau where Gohan stands; A from his right
# side starts "TRUNKS: What, are you crazy?..." > the rain scene.
# Finding: nba rolls different stats for Trunks (pause > Status at f9315 of
# an earlier session: nba HP 148/148, EP 27/31, STR 11, POW 9, END 7;
# dingbat-bios and mgba HP 145/145, EP 34/34, STR 12, POW 8, END 8), and its
# HUD energy bar is visibly shorter from the end of the training on. nba also
# needed more A taps to leave the second story page (16 against 10).

